course: dictionary
lesson: 7754
title: One word, two meanings
level: primary-6
stars: 0
explain: Many words have more than one meaning, and context tells you which one the writer means. The word pup can mean a young dog, or the baby of some other animals. «Our new pup chewed my shoe» is about a puppy, because of the words new and chewed.
explain: «A seal pup alone on a beach is usually waiting for its mother, so stay well away.» Here pup means a baby seal. Ask yourself what the sentence tells you: it is on a beach, it has a mother, and people should keep away. Those clues show the animal sense, not the dog sense.
explain: Check your meaning by swapping it into the sentence. Try «a baby seal alone on a beach is usually waiting for its mother» and it still makes sense, so your choice fits. If a meaning does not fit, look for another one.
fact: Pup is a noun: a pup is a young dog, or a puppy.
fact: A pup can also be the baby of other animals, such as seals, otters, wolves, foxes, rats and bats.
fact: «Harp seal pups are born white on the ice, turn grey after a few weeks, and grow very fast on milk that is about half fat.»
fact: «Wolf pups» live in a den, and «a litter of pups» means all the babies born together.
fact: Pup can also be a verb: for some animals, to pup means to give birth.
exercise: «The little pup wagged its tail and ran to greet us.» What is the pup? | A small wolf in a den | *A young dog | A baby seal on the ice | A bat hanging in a cave
exercise: «Harp seal pups are born white on the ice.» Which animal is the pup? | A dog in a house | A rat | *A harp seal | A fox
exercise: What does «a litter of pups» mean? | A pile of food for the animals | A group of dogs at a show | *All the babies born together | A sleeping den on the hill
test: «A seal pup alone on a beach is usually waiting for its mother.» What is the pup? | A sea bird | A rock on the sand | *A baby seal | A young dog
test: In «grown-ups even teach the pups how to eat a scorpion safely», what does pups mean? | *Baby meerkats | Beetles that dig in the sand | Puppies from a house | Grown-up scorpions
exam: In «a company was reported to have made wolf pups», what does pups mean? | A toy wolf | A type of bat | *Baby wolves | A grey dog
